    "_source": "Ranks 1-7 for all 4 factions confirmed via a headless-browser carousel crawl of the SR:TS Information Hub's 'Reputation' page (favored per project convention). Rank 8 for all factions was Fandom-sourced but now matches the Info Hub (2026-10 re-crawl) (screenshots, user-provided) - the crawl's final click on this carousel silently failed, likely because the '>' button disappears rather than disables on the last slide, so it never reached rank 8. Reward SCOPE clarified via the same Framer crawl: reward text literally reads '+50% Money from Reputation Quests' on every rank 1-7 - confirmed to apply to quest payouts only, NOT to regular trade-good selling profit. Do not apply this bonus in the trade route calculator.",
